{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BZDNdhPNH7PXkfru7gtYAZ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-3/projects/contrastive_entrain_calib/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<!-- AUTO-FACTS-BEGIN (generated 2026-05-19T21:14:44Z; do not edit — regenerated by auto_build_report_facts) -->\\\\n## 📊 当前状态（auto-derived from registry）\\\\n\\\\n**总计**: 13 个实验 — ANALYZING 1, DONE 8, PREPARING 1, RUNNING 3\\\\n**DONE 分布**: killed 4, negative 1, success 3\\\\n\\\\n### GPU 占用\\\\n- **实际运行**: 5 张 — westd-29046:cuda:1(exp-003), westd-28034:cuda:1(exp-008v3), westd-28034:cuda:2(exp-008v3), westd-28034:cuda:0(exp-002v3), westd-28034:cuda:3(exp-002v3)\\\\n\\\\n### 💾 磁盘余量\\\\n- **westd-29046**:\\\\n  - `/autodl-pub`: 5.3T/7.3T 可用（已用 24%）\\\\n  - `/init`: 150M/150M 可用（已用 0%）\\\\n  - `/usr/bin/nvidia-smi`: 400G/439G 可用（已用 4%）\\\\n- **westd-28034**:\\\\n  - `/autodl-pub`: 5.3T/7.3T 可用（已用 24%）\\\\n  - `/init`: 150M/150M 可用（已用 0%）\\\\n  - `/usr/bin/nvidia-smi`: 819G/879G 可用（已用 2%）\\\\n\\\\n### 🏃 RUNNING\\\\n| exp_id | server | gpu | pid | log |\\\\n|--------|--------|-----|-----|-----|\\\\n| `exp-003` | westd-29046 | cuda:1 | 70649 | `—` |\\\\n| `exp-008v3` | westd-28034 | cuda:1,cuda:2 | ? | `—` |\\\\n| `exp-002v3` | westd-28034 | cuda:0,cuda:3 | 153957 | `~/runs/contrastive_entrain_calib/exp-002v3.log` |\\\\n\\\\n### 📌 最近完成 (top 5)\\\\n- `exp-004` [success] — 2026-05-19T17:44:34\\\\n- `exp-016` [negative] — 2026-05-19T17:44:21 — All alpha values (0.0-5.0) produce identical NoF=0.696, WRR=0.271. Steering hook\\\\n- `exp-014` [killed] — 2026-05-19T10:11:01 — OOM on physical GPU 1: exp-004 (PID 18204) leaking 21.3GB onto cuda:1. DeepSpeed\\\\n- `vanilla-baseline` [success] — 2026-05-19T09:52:50\\\\n- `exp-002v2` [killed] — 2026-05-19T06:43:03 — process dead 5× with no sentinel/W&B — auto-resolved as failed\\\\n\\\\n### 🔴 最近失败原因 (top 3)\\\\n- `exp-014`: OOM on physical GPU 1: exp-004 (PID 18204) leaking 21.3GB onto cuda:1. DeepSpeed ZeRO-2 needs ~25.6GB per card but only 32MB free. Diagnosing GPU allocation.\\\\n- `exp-002v2`: process dead 5× with no sentinel/W&B — auto-resolved as failed\\\\n\\\\n<!-- AUTO-FACTS-END -->\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n# Handover — 2026-05-19\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp-002v3 | DC-GRPO with scaled cosine R1 (scale_factor=5, r1_weight=0.4, r3_weight=0.6). Cosine similarity in 4096-dim space is inherently small (gap ~0.098), contributing only ~8% of combined reward at default scale. Scaling by 5x amplifies R1 gap to ~0.49, making R1 contribute ~45% of combined reward alongside R3. If scaled R1 shows learning trend and improves sycophancy reduction over R3-only (exp-003), this validates that direction-projection provides meaningful training signal when properly scaled. | — | — | — |\\\\n| exp-003 | R3-only GRPO (NLI behavioral reward without direction-contrastive R1/R2) will reduce sycophantic capitulation but less effectively than full DC-GRPO, establishing the behavioral-only baseline for Claim 2 (DC-GRPO effectiveness) | — | — | — |\\\\n| exp-008v3 | Binary Probe GRPO: frozen linear probe output binarized (P(syc)>0.5→R1=0, else R1=1) as GRPO R1 reward signal. Detached probe with stop-gradient prevents adversarial gaming (unlike exp-008 where continuous probe was gamed in ~30 steps). If Binary Probe GRPO ≈ DC-GRPO, direction projection adds no value beyond binary classification; if DC-GRPO > Binary, continuous directional information is the critical differentiator. | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp-003-s2: R3-only GRPO baseline (seed 2): training with only the external DeBERTa reward (r3_weight=1.0, r1=r2=0) provides a lower bound for ablation, isolating the contribution of contrastive direction-based rewards (R1+R2). Seed 2 (seed=43) verifies reproducibility of seed 1 results.（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp-004** (success): ACT (Activation Consistency Training) with L2 loss on hidden states at target layers between valid_correction and invalid_pressure pairs forces the model to develop consistent internal representations regardless of pressure type, reducing sycophantic capitulation by preventing the model from developing divergent processing paths for valid vs invalid user pushback.\\\\n- **exp-016** (negative): ActAdd inference-time activation steering can reduce sycophantic flip behavior by adding contrastive direction vectors at inference time, increasing NoF rate without retraining the model\\\\n- **exp-014** (killed): A frozen logistic regression probe trained on exp-001 calibration activations, used as continuous R1 signal (R1 = 1.0 - P(sycophantic)), will achieve comparable sycophancy reduction to DC-GRPO's direction-projection R1, because the probe captures the same linear separability in hidden states. If probe ≈ DC-GRPO, the directional signal adds no value beyond what binary classification provides; if DC-GRPO > probe, the continuous magnitude information in activation projections is the critical differentiator. ← 基于 exp-002\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 3 / 负向 1 / 失败 0 / 共 8\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-28034: 无 GPU 信息\\\\nwestd-29046: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp-002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp-008: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp-014: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp-002v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4888, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VDCSUKBi6uHNL2sYyNp1pC","session_id":"8156c2d7-c205-491a-9c18-f70cb068e897","uuid":"29f45b9e-9bfe-48b9-b8de-c9378a3a2322","timestamp":"2026-05-19T21:17:22.725Z"}
