{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BLCNiCkEZA9bEZKDjRSD7Z","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-3/projects/contrastive_entrain_calib/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# contrastive_entrain_calib — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-19 19:23 UTC | 更新原因: paper_framing.md D029 更新完成，同步刷新 ROADMAP 进展数据\\\\n\\\\n> 详见 paper_framing.md (story/claims) 和 experiment_plan.yaml (完整实验列表)\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nRepE-style d_syc 方向分解作为 GRPO reward 信号。**D029: Story A (continuous cosine) 失败，Story B (binary probe) 升为主线。** 论文叙事：\\\\\\\"方向信息存在(AUROC 0.82)但需 binarization 才能成为有效 reward——discriminability ≠ reward utility\\\\\\\"。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\n**EMNLP 2026** — ARR May cycle 提交截止 **May 25, 2026**。等待用户决策（May 25 vs August ARR）。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research Phase** — Story B 为主线，等 exp-008v3 + exp-003 完成。paper_framing.md 已更新 D029 pivot。\\\\n\\\\n## 关键发现\\\\n1. **D029: Story A 死亡** — 四次验证（tanh/cosine/recalib/5x scale）cosine R1 作为连续 reward 无效。Per-strength 分析：strong evidence R1=-0.305 全负，d_syc 无法区分合理修正与 sycophantic capitulation。根因：cosine 捕捉 belief change 的方向，但合理修正和 sycophantic capitulation 都朝用户方向变化。\\\\n2. **Story B 前景好** — exp-008v3 binary probe R1 均值 +0.72（step 2140），持续正值，上升趋势。\\\\n3. **D028: exp-016 ActAdd 有害** — D027 eval 下 SYCONScore 降至 0.054 < vanilla 0.134。\\\\n4. **D028: exp-004 ACT 有效** — SYCONScore 0.301 (+16.8pp vs vanilla)。当前 bar：DC-GRPO 需 > 0.301。\\\\n5. **D027 vanilla baseline** — ToF=0.072, NoF=0.945, SYCONScore=0.134（D027 NLI-based）。\\\\n6. **clipped_ratio 96.9%** — 训练配置问题（max_completion_length=256 太短），非 reward hacking。\\\\n\\\\n## 实验状态\\\\n| exp_id | 状态 | 角色 | 服务器 | 进展 | ETA |\\\\n|--------|------|------|--------|------|-----|\\\\n| exp-008v3 | 🟢 RUNNING | **主实验 (Story B)** | 28034 GPU 1+2 | step ~2140/8000 (~27%) | ~May 21 13:00 |\\\\n| exp-003 | 🟢 RUNNING | 关键 baseline (R3-only) | 29046 GPU 1 | step ~3188/8000 (~40%) | ~May 21 下午 |\\\\n| exp-002v3 | 🟢 RUNNING | Negative evidence (Story A) | 28034 GPU 0+3 | early | ~May 22 |\\\\n| exp002v2-recalib | 🟢 RUNNING | Negative evidence (mode collapsed) | 29046 GPU 0 | step ~2842/8000 (~35%) | ~May 20 晚 |\\\\n| exp-004 | ✅ DONE | ACT baseline | — | SYCONScore 0.301 | — |\\\\n| exp-016 | ❌ NEGATIVE | ActAdd 有害 | — | SYCONScore 0.054 | — |\\\\n| exp-014 | ❌ KILLED | Mode collapse | — | — | — |\\\\n| exp-001 | ✅ DONE | Direction extraction | — | AUROC 0.827 | — |\\\\n| vanilla | ✅ DONE | Baseline | — | SYCONScore 0.134 | — |\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 使用 (6/6 满载)\\\\n| 服务器 | GPU | 任务 |\\\\n|--------|-----|----------|\\\\n| 28034 GPU 0+3 | exp-002v3 (negative evidence) | 🟢 |\\\\n| 28034 GPU 1+2 | exp-008v3 (**主实验**) | 🟢 |\\\\n| 29046 GPU 0 | exp002v2-recalib (negative evidence) | 🟢 |\\\\n| 29046 GPU 1 | exp-003 (关键 baseline) | 🟢 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] D029: Story A→B narrative pivot\\\\n- [x] 更新 paper_framing.md（D029 narrative pivot）\\\\n- [ ] exp002v2-recalib 完成 → eval on 29046 GPU 0（预期 mode collapse，entropy 0.069）\\\\n- [ ] exp-008v3 step 4000 mid-training eval → 转 LoRA adapter 到 29046 eval\\\\n- [ ] exp-003 完成 → eval + 与 exp-008v3 对比（binary probe R1 增量价值）\\\\n- [ ] exp-008v3 完成 → final eval（**论文核心数据**，SYCONScore 必须 > 0.301）\\\\n- [ ] exp-002v3 完成 → eval（negative evidence 完整性）\\\\n- [ ] exp-003-s2 部署（29046 GPU 0 空闲后）\\\\n- [ ] 用户 venue 决策（May 25 vs August ARR）\\\\n\\\\n## ⚠️ 关键风险\\\\n1. **exp-008v3 必须成功** — Story B 唯一支柱。SYCONScore ≤ 0.301 → 论文降级为 analysis paper (Findings)\\\\n2. **EMNLP DDL** — May 25 仅 6 天，核心实验 May 21 完成，用户尚未决定投 May 还是 August\\\\n3. **D027 ToF 偏低** — vanilla ToF=0.072，需 spot-check NLI 分类准确性\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- westd-29046: 2/2 满载\\\\n- westd-28034: 4/4 满载\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-19 | D030: Probe ablation 确认 d_syc 方向是关键（+0.108 AUROC v | probe_ablation_AB |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-19 | D029: Story A (continuous cosine R1) 宣告失败，Story B  | exp-002v3, exp-008v3, exp002v2-recalib, exp-003 |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-19 | D028: exp-002v3 审批通过立即部署 + exp-016 结论反转 + D027 bas | exp-002v3, exp-016, exp-004 |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-19 | 统一评估指标标准：废弃 WRR，主报 ToF/NoF/SYCONScore，NLI-based 分类 | vanilla-baseline, exp-016 |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-19 | exp-002v3 设计：scale_factor=5 + R1=0.4/R3=0.6，exp-00 | exp-002v2, exp-002v3 |\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-19 | D024 drift 确认为误报（cosine=0.96 非 0.28），不再 kill exp00 | exp-002v2, exp-003 |\\\\n| D024 | 2026-05-19 | Kill exp-002v2 并带 recalibration_interval=500 重启：方向 | exp-002v2, exp-006 |\\\\n| D023 | 2026-05-19 | Kill exp-014 (mode collapse confirmed), GPU 1+2 →  | exp-014, exp-008 |\\\\n| D022 | 2026-05-19 | exp-014 reward 饱和诊断：R3=0.999 + loss=0 + grad_norm= | exp-014, exp-003-s2 |\\\\n| D021 | 2026-05-19 | Kill exp-002v2 (step 183)，禁用 adaptive gate 后重启：gat | exp-002v2, exp-003 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4226, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01VDCSUKBi6uHNL2sYyNp1pC","session_id":"8156c2d7-c205-491a-9c18-f70cb068e897","uuid":"a4ada877-4993-420b-a72f-7871d2085cab","timestamp":"2026-05-19T21:17:29.039Z"}
